OL,3,GNEWSABig dogs face longer wait for
OL,4,Ahomes, charities say
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnimal rescue centres across south-west
OL,7,FEngland say large dogs are now waiting
OL,8,Flonger to find new homes.
OL,10,FWoodside Animal Sanctuary in Plymouth
OL,11,Fsaid its kennels were full as well as a
OL,12,Fwaitlist of more than 40 large dogs. It
OL,13,Fsaid the cost of owning a bigger dog
OL,14,Fputs some people off, while many larger
OL,15,Fanimals need extra training before they
OL,16,Fcan be rehomed.
OL,18,FThe RSPCA Cornwall Animal Centre said
OL,19,Fthe big dogs in its care now wait an
OL,20,Faverage of six months or more to find a
OL,21,Fnew home.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
