OL,3,GNEWSABig dogs face longer wait for
OL,4,Ahomes, charities say
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe charity said larger dog breeds
OL,7,Fcould take up to seven times longer to
OL,8,Fbe rehomed than smaller breeds and it
OL,9,Fwas part of a wider rehoming crisis
OL,10,Faffecting rescue organisations.
